        <UserObject id="atomic_note" label="&lt;b&gt;Atomicity&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;burnFrom is a void call: success means no revert.&lt;br&gt;Earlier voting writes remain provisional&lt;br&gt;until the whole transaction succeeds.&lt;br&gt;eligible[id][voter] stays unchanged." data-source="contracts/contracts/Voting.sol" data-role="note">
